        "responseBody": "<html>\n<body style=\"font-family: sans-serif; text-align: center; padding: 60px;\">\n  <h1>⚠️ Invalid or Expired Link</h1>\n  <p>This approval link is no longer valid. It may have expired (48h) or already been used.</p>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
